            },
            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Hmmm... As there is a precedent in [`MiniStarter.sections.recent_files()`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/334a2d9cfbd86ea08c4d870e39b5ba8bb354d938/doc/mini-starter.txt#L367) with `current_dir` flag, I think having same flag in `local_opts` of `MiniExtra.pickers.oldfiles()` might be a good idea.\r\n\r\nYou're welcome to create an issue about this (or straight up PR, if you'd like; should be a three line change in code plus docs and tests).",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hmmm... As there is a precedent in <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/334a2d9cfbd86ea08c4d870e39b5ba8bb354d938/doc/mini-starter.txt#L367\"><code class=\"notranslate\">MiniStarter.sections.recent_files()</code></a> with <code class=\"notranslate\">current_dir</code> flag, I think having same flag in <code class=\"notranslate\">local_opts</code> of <code class=\"notranslate\">MiniExtra.pickers.oldfiles()</code> might be a good idea.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">You're welcome to create an issue about this (or straight up PR, if you'd like; should be a three line change in code plus docs and tests).</p>",
